/**
 * Information architecture for the admin ops portal.
 *
 * The sidebar shows one TOP-LEVEL ENTRY per destination cluster (14 of them,
 * across 5 sections). Every entry carries an icon and links to `tabs[0]`; its
 * remaining members are reached from a horizontal sub-tab bar rendered once by
 * the admin layout via <AdminSubTabs /> (see components/admin/SubTabs.tsx).
 *
 * That keeps all ~41 admin routes exactly two clicks away while the sidebar
 * stays short enough to fit a 1080p laptop with no scrolling — the previous
 * shapes (6 collapsed group headers, then 41 flat rows) failed at one end or
 * the other. No route was moved or removed: every URL that worked before still
